        },
        {
          "text": "Nubwo omukama Nebbukadaneeza yahuniriire muno, nukwo kwimuka bwango, yakaguza ati: “Abasaija abasatu bali, titubanagirege omumurro baboherwe?” Baagarukamu omukama bati: “Ego, nukwo tukozire.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama yagarukamu ati: “kandi ka nindora abasaija bbana abataboherwe, nibarubatarubata omu murro hagati, kandi tibarukutaaga; kandi enzooka ey'owa kana, neesisana omwana wa ba ruhanga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abasatu nibalekerwa kandi nibakuzibwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nubwo Nebbukadaneeza yairiire haihi ekyoto eky'omurro ogu ogurukumekuka yayeta ati: “Saduraaka, Mesaaka, n'Abedeneego, inywe abaheereza ba Ruhanga anyakuli haiguru muno, mwerugireyo mwije hanu!” Saduraaka, Mesaaka n'Abedeneego baaruga bwango omu murro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abamasaza, abamyoka, abalemi, n'abahi b'amagezi baayesorooza, baarora abasaija abo omurro nkooku gutarabakozireho kantu; isoke erya ha mitwe yabo nalyo litahye, ebyokujwara byabo bitookebwe murro kandi bakaba batarukunuunka omwika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama Nebbukadaneeza nukwo kugamba ati: “Akugizibwe Ruhanga wa Saduraaka, Mesaaka, n'Abedeneego, anyakutumire malaika we yajuna abairu be abamwesigire, abaagayire ekiragiro ky'omukama, baahayo emibiri yabo, baitu baayanga kuheereza n'okuramya embandwa kwihaho Ruhanga wabo wenka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hati ninturukya ekiragiro ekirukugamba kiti: Abantu ab'amahanga goona, ab'enganda zoona kandi ab'engambo zoona, kakuba habaho omuntu arukubazaaho kubi Ruhanga owa Saduraaka, Mesaaka, n'Abedeneego, ogu atemwatemwe n'amaju gaabo gaseeswe; habw'okuba tiharoho embandwa erukusobora kujuna ati.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama yakuza Saduraaka, Mesaaka, n'Abedeneego omu isaza Babbulooni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
